<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow,noarchive"><title>My Hospital Review · I Love My Body</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/ilmb-brand.css?v=2"><style>
:root{--bg:#fff;--card:#fff;--ink:#000;--muted:rgba(0,0,0,.62);--line:rgba(0,0,0,.14);--pink:#FF008C}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:#fff;color:#000;font:15px/1.55 system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,sans-serif}.wrap{max-width:1480px;margin:auto;padding:22px 18px 70px}.top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:14px;align-items:center}.brand b{display:block;font-size:20px}.brand small{color:var(--muted);letter-spacing:.12em}.back{color:var(--pink);text-decoration:none;font-weight:700}.hero{margin:30px 0 18px;padding:28px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:22px;background:#fff}.hero h1{margin:6px 0 8px;font:600 clamp(36px,5vw,62px)/1.02 Georgia,serif}.hero p{max-width:980px;color:var(--muted);font-size:17px}.ey{color:var(--pink);font-size:11px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.14em}.summary{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:12px}.sum,.section,.result,.doc,.path{padding:16px;border-radius:16px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:#fff}.sum b{font-size:28px}.sum span{display:block;color:var(--muted)}.section{margin-top:18px;padding:22px;border-radius:20px}h2{margin:4px 0 6px;font:600 30px Georgia,serif}.lead{color:var(--muted);max-width:1020px}.cards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:12px;margin-top:16px}.pill{display:inline-block;padding:4px 8px;border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.16);border-radius:999px;font-size:10px;font-weight:800}.medicine-table{overflow:auto;margin-top:14px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:16px}table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;min-width:1500px}th,td{padding:14px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);vertical-align:top;text-align:left}th{background:#000;color:#fff;font-size:11px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em;position:sticky;top:0}td:first-child{font-weight:800}.harm,.ilmb{background:#fff}.path-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:12px;margin-top:14px}.path{border-top:4px solid var(--pink)}.path h3{margin:5px 0 8px}.path dl{margin:0}.path dl div{display:grid;grid-template-columns:130px 1fr;gap:12px;padding:8px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}.path dt{font-weight:800;color:var(--pink)}.path dd{margin:0}.docs{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:10px;margin-top:14px}.doc small{display:block;color:var(--muted)}.identity{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:12px}.identity span{padding:8px 10px;border-radius:999px;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);font-size:12px}.boundary,.loop{margin-top:18px;padding:14px;border-left:4px solid var(--pink);background:#fff}.loop{font-weight:900;font-family:ui-monospace,Consolas,monospace}.empty{color:var(--muted);padding:16px 0}.actions{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:16px}.actions a{padding:10px 14px;border-radius:999px;text-decoration:none;border:1px solid var(--line);color:#000;background:#fff}.actions a.primary{background:var(--pink);color:#fff;border-color:var(--pink)}@media(max-width:900px){.summary,.cards,.docs,.path-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.hero{padding:20px}.top{align-items:flex-start;flex-direction:column-reverse}.path dl div{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style></head><body><main class="wrap"><div class="top"><a class="back" href="/app/">← My Happy Space</a><div class="brand"><b>I Love My Body</b><small>MY HOSPITAL REVIEW</small></div></div><section class="hero"><div class="ey">REPORTS · PRESCRIPTIONS · ILMB PATH</div><h1>Understand what your records are saying — and what happens next.</h1><p>We start with what is reassuring, then what needs attention, then what remains unknown. Medicines are explained as desired effect → mechanism → collateral burden → ILMB target → actual ILMB route → action → measurement → decision rule.</p><div class="actions"><a class="primary" href="/app/test-results.php">Add exact test values</a><a href="/app/#records">Upload reports / prescriptions</a></div></section><div id="loading">Building your review…</div><div id="content" hidden><div class="summary"><div class="sum"><div class="ey">REASSURING</div><b id="goodN">0</b><span>Within the printed reference range</span></div><div class="sum"><div class="ey">NEEDS ATTENTION</div><b id="attnN">0</b><span>Outside the printed range</span></div><div class="sum"><div class="ey">UNKNOWN / NOT YET MAPPED</div><b id="unkN">0</b><span>Kept open rather than guessed</span></div></div><section class="section"><div class="ey">MY REPORTS</div><h2>Optimistic, factual reading</h2><p class="lead" id="summaryText"></p><div class="cards" id="results"></div></section><section class="section"><div class="ey">MY PRESCRIPTION</div><h2>Why each medicine is there — and how ILMB compares</h2><p class="lead">A side effect listed here is a known possibility, not something we assume you personally have. ILMB never claims direct receptor equivalence unless it has been demonstrated.</p><div class="medicine-table"><table><thead><tr><th>Medicine</th><th>Desired effect</th><th>How it achieves it</th><th>Important collateral / side-effect path</th><th>ILMB target</th><th>Actual ILMB route</th><th>What proves the result</th></tr></thead><tbody id="meds"></tbody></table></div></section><section class="section"><div class="ey">MY ACTUAL ILMB PATH</div><h2>What ILMB does next for each body goal</h2><p class="lead">Each path has an equivalence status, route, action, duration, measurement and decision rule. If the identity or evidence is unresolved, the path stays blocked instead of being guessed.</p><div class="path-grid" id="paths"></div><div class="loop" id="loop"></div></section><section class="section"><div class="ey">SOURCE DOCUMENTS</div><h2>What has been received</h2><div class="docs" id="docs"></div></section><section class="section"><div class="ey">BACKGROUND IDENTITY LAYER</div><h2>How the database keeps the meaning exact</h2><div class="identity" id="identity"></div><div class="boundary" id="boundary"></div></section></div></main><script>
const esc=s=>String(s??'').replace(/[&<>"']/g,c=>({'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','"':'&quot;',"'":'&#39;'}[c]));
async function load(){try{const r=await fetch('hospital-review-api.php');const j=await r.json();if(!r.ok||!j.ok)throw Error(j.error||'Could not build the review.');loading.hidden=true;content.hidden=false;goodN.textContent=j.summary.reassuring;attnN.textContent=j.summary.attention;unkN.textContent=j.summary.unknown;summaryText.textContent=j.summary.message;results.innerHTML=j.results.length?j.results.map(x=>`<article class="result"><span class="pill">${esc(x.status.toUpperCase())}</span><h3>${esc(x.name)}</h3><b>${esc(x.value)} ${esc(x.unit||'')}</b><p>${esc(x.headline)}</p><p>${esc(x.meaning)}</p><small>${x.range?'Printed range: '+esc(x.range):'No machine-readable range'}${x.loinc?' · LOINC '+esc(x.loinc):''}</small></article>`).join(''):'<p class="empty">No structured test values yet. Add values exactly as printed on the report.</p>';meds.innerHTML=j.medicines.length?j.medicines.map(m=>`<tr><td>${esc(m.reported_name)}<br><small>${esc(m.strength_text||'')}</small></td><td>${esc(m.effect)}</td><td>${esc(m.mechanism)}</td><td class="harm">${esc(m.collateral)}</td><td class="ilmb">${esc(m.ilmb)}</td><td>${esc(m.route)}</td><td>${esc(m.measure)}</td></tr>`).join(''):'<tr><td colspan="7">No active medicines recorded.</td></tr>';paths.innerHTML=j.ilmb_paths.length?j.ilmb_paths.map(p=>`<article class="path"><div class="ey">${esc(p.medicine)}</div><h3>${esc(p.goal)}</h3><dl><div><dt>Equivalence</dt><dd>${esc(p.equivalence)}</dd></div><div><dt>Route</dt><dd>${esc(p.route)}</dd></div><div><dt>Action now</dt><dd>${esc(p.action)}</dd></div><div><dt>Duration</dt><dd>${esc(p.duration)}</dd></div><div><dt>Measure</dt><dd>${esc(p.measure)}</dd></div><div><dt>Decision</dt><dd>${esc(p.decision)}</dd></div></dl></article>`).join(''):'<p class="empty">No medicine-linked ILMB paths are available yet.</p>';loop.textContent=j.loop;docs.innerHTML=j.documents.length?j.documents.map(d=>`<div class="doc"><b>${esc(d.original_filename||d.document_type)}</b><small>${esc(d.document_date||'Date not supplied')} · ${esc(String(d.document_type).replaceAll('_',' '))}</small><p>${esc(d.patient_message)}</p></div>`).join(''):'<p class="empty">No documents uploaded yet.</p>';identity.innerHTML=Object.entries(j.identity_layer).map(([k,v])=>`<span><b>${esc(k.toUpperCase())}</b> · ${esc(v)}</span>`).join('');boundary.textContent=j.boundary}catch(e){loading.textContent=e.message}}load();
</script></body></html>